<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Library</OutputType>
    <RootNamespace>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Computing.ILCuda</RootNamespace>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <PlatformTarget>x64</PlatformTarget>
    <LangVersion>latest</LangVersion>
    <OptionExplicit>On</OptionExplicit>
    <OptionInfer>On</OptionInfer>
    <Nullable>disable</Nullable>
    <AssemblyName>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Computing.ILCuda</AssemblyName>
    <InvariantGlobalization>true</InvariantGlobalization>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>false</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <Description>Dependency-free VB.NET CUDA framework built on the CUDA Driver API and NVRTC: device, context, stream and device-memory management, JIT compilation of embedded .cu sources, kernel catalog and launch planning, reduction, elementwise and BLAS kernels, plus an IL-to-CUDA emitter.</Description>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;nuget_release;Rsharp_app_release</Configurations>
    <Title>ILCuda: Pure-Interop VB.NET CUDA Compute Framework</Title>
    <AssemblyTitle>Microsoft.VisualBasic.Computing.ILCuda</AssemblyTitle>
    <Authors>xieguigang &lt;I@xieguigang.me&gt;</Authors>
    <Company>sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Company>
    <Copyright>Copyright (c) sciBASIC.NET Foundation</Copyright>
    <PackageProjectUrl>http://scibasic.net/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/xieguigang/sciBASIC</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageTags>scibasic;cuda;nvrtc;gpu;interop;cuda-driver-api;kernels;blas;jit-compilation;il-to-cuda</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>ILCuda is the dependency-free CUDA compute framework of sciBASIC#, built directly on the CUDA Driver API (nvcuda.dll) and NVRTC - no CUDA Runtime, no C++/CLI and no third party wrapper. Interop layer: the full DllImport surface of the driver API with Check() helpers, the NVRTC dynamic binding (NativeLibrary + GetDelegateForFunctionPointer), and the CUresult / CUdevice_attribute / nvrtcResult enums plus CudaException. Runtime layer: device attributes, primary context management, PTX/cubin module loading, kernel launching with argument marshalling, streams and events for copy/compute overlap and GPU side timing, typed device buffers and pinned host buffers, and a LaunchPlanner deriving grid/block sizes. Compilation: NvrtcCompiler obtains kernel images through multiple channels (NVRTC compile, precompiled image, failure diagnostics) while CubinInspector pre-checks driver compatibility. Kernels: an embedded source catalog with basic (vecAdd / saxpy), two-stage generic reduction, elementwise operators and a BLAS subset (tiled GEMM / GEMV). Diagnostics: structured DeviceReport / EnvironmentReport / FixSuggestion output that explains driver or toolkit version mismatches. The IL2Cuda namespace adds the CudaKernel attribute family, the .NET to CUDA type map and an IL emitter that turns marked method bodies into CUDA C source.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>GPL-3.0-or-later</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageIcon>logo-knot.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <Version>1.0.9758.20045</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>1.0.9758.20045</AssemblyVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='nuget_release|x64'">
    <PlatformTarget>x64</PlatformTarget>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(Platform)'=='Rsharp_app_release|x64'">
    <PlatformTarget>x64</PlatformTarget>
    <OutputPath>../../.nuget/</OutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="test\**" />
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="test\**" />
    <None Remove="test\**" />
    <None Include="..\..\vs_solutions\logo-knot.png">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
    <None Include="README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <!--
      CUDA C 内核源码以内嵌资源的形式随框架分发，运行时由 NVRTC 即时编译。
      这里逐个显式列出（而不是用通配符），避免把 emit-kernels 导出的
      合并文件 all.cu 一起打包进来造成内核函数重复定义。
    -->
    <EmbeddedResource Include="Kernels\basic.cu" />
    <EmbeddedResource Include="Kernels\reduce.cu" />
    <EmbeddedResource Include="Kernels\elementwise.cu" />
    <EmbeddedResource Include="Kernels\blas.cu" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\Microsoft.VisualBasic.Core\src\Core.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\vs_solutions\dev\VisualStudio\VisualStudio.NET5.vbproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
